    "name": "Volcano Engine Ark API (Doubao) Batch Videos API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Volcano Engine Ark serves ByteDance's Doubao foundation models with an OpenAI-compatible API surface. Provides chat completions, embeddings, image generation (Seedream), video generation (Seedance), and batch operations. Endpoints derived from public Volcano Engine documentation at https://www.volcengine.com/docs/82379 — best-effort, not exhaustive. Authenticates with a Bearer API key minted in the Ark console.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Volcano Engine",
